# Testing Patterns

SoT: [`.specs/codebase/TESTING.md`](../../.specs/codebase/TESTING.md). Mock SoT: [INTEGRATIONS.md](../../.specs/codebase/INTEGRATIONS.md) + TESTING.md § Mock boundaries. Required gate: [quality-gates.mdc](quality-gates.mdc).

## Enforcement

- Follow TESTING.md § Coverage — do not weaken thresholds to greenwash a change
- Mock at adapter boundaries only (git → `GitMiner`; worker pool / file I/O → ComplexityAnalyzer) — see INTEGRATIONS.md
- Prefer co-located `*.test.ts`; parse tests use `tests/fixtures/git-log/` and `tests/fixtures/complexity/`
- CLI tests (`bin/*.test.ts`): `vi.resetModules()` before dynamic `import()`; mock `process.stdout.write` / `process.exit` as needed
- Contract tests must stay green after schema edits
